      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Load 3D into LATO.2\n\n**Load 3D** loads and shows a mesh (its **upload 3d model** button adds one); its **model_3d** output goes into LATO.2's **mesh** input, which overrides the node's own file picker.\n\nAny node that outputs a `MESH` or a 3D file can feed LATO.2 the same way."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Load 3D into LATO.2\n\n**Load 3D** loads and shows a mesh (its **upload 3d model** button adds one); its **model_3d** output goes into LATO.2's **mesh** input, which overrides the node's own file picker.\n\nAny node that outputs a `MESH` or a 3D file can feed LATO.2 the same way."
      },
